{% comment %}
  Playful, illustrated product-page strip driven by the "custom.city_theme"
  metafield (single line text). Three kinds of entries share this registry:
  city scenes ("mumbai", "delhi") - an associative styling device (this
  dish is often eaten in X city), not a factual origin claim - product-
  specific effects ("chilli-flakes") for a product whose visual treatment
  doesn't fit the city-scene idea at all, and a generic "spice-dust" wash
  that's the fallback for every other product so nothing on the catalog
  is left with no PDP animation at all, without inventing a city story
  for a product that doesn't have one (per CLAUDE.md - don't fake brand
  facts, flag them instead).

  Registry pattern: to add another entry, drop in one more {%- when -%}
  block below with its own inline SVG and a matching CSS block in
  vishesh-sections.css (.vishesh-city-scene--<key> ...). Flat-design
  vector line art, brand palette only, no photography, no trademarked
  monument renders - the Delhi arch below is a generic gateway silhouette,
  not a specific landmark.

  The suggested product -> city mapping (Pavbhaji/Frankie -> Mumbai) is a
  starting guess flagged for the brand to confirm before launch, same as
  other placeholder facts in this project - see CLAUDE.md. Phase 7 audit:
  19 of 22 live products have no city_theme set at all and get the
  spice-dust fallback below rather than a guessed city - several read
  like plausible street-food candidates (Panipuri Masala, Dabeli Masala)
  but assigning them a city is a brand call, not a theme-code call, so
  they're left on the neutral default until the brand confirms.

  Phase 11 note: "gujarat" was referenced in the product-assignment brief
  as an existing scene to "finish if stubbed," but it did not exist in
  this registry at all before Phase 11 - not even a stub. Built fresh
  here, to the same level of finish as the other Phase 11 additions
  (bihar, kolkata, kolkata-tangra, lucknow, kerala, kashmir, kolhapur).
  All 8 of these regional scenes are a confirmed creative device (this
  dish is often associated with X region), not a factual claim about the
  product's actual origin - same framing as the original mumbai/delhi
  entries above.

  kolkata-tangra shares its base layer (bridge silhouette + tram loop)
  with kolkata rather than duplicating it - only the foreground group
  (lanterns/wok vs. kulhad) and accent color differ, per the brief's
  explicit "variant, not separate from scratch" instruction.

  Accepts: product (required)
{% endcomment %}

{%- assign city = product.metafields.custom.city_theme.value | default: '' | downcase | strip -%}
{%- assign vishesh_known_cities = 'mumbai|delhi|chilli-flakes|gujarat|bihar|kolkata|kolkata-tangra|lucknow|kerala|kashmir|kolhapur' | split: '|' -%}
{%- unless vishesh_known_cities contains city -%}
  {%- assign city = 'spice-dust' -%}
{%- endunless -%}

<div class="vishesh-city-scene vishesh-city-scene--{{ city }}" data-animate="fade-up">
    <div class="page-width vishesh-city-scene__header">
      {%- comment -%}
        The sound button belongs to this moment, not the price row it
        used to sit in - it plays the sound of the scene beside it.
        Same snippet, same data-sound-key / aria wiring, just rendered
        here instead.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <p class="vishesh-city-scene__caption">
        {%- if city == 'mumbai' -%}
          A taste that feels like Mumbai's streets
        {%- elsif city == 'delhi' -%}
          A taste that feels like Delhi's galis
        {%- elsif city == 'chilli-flakes' -%}
          A pinch of heat in every batch
        {%- elsif city == 'gujarat' -%}
          A taste from Gujarat's own kitchens
        {%- elsif city == 'bihar' -%}
          A taste that feels like Bihar's ghats
        {%- elsif city == 'kolkata' -%}
          A taste that feels like Kolkata's trams
        {%- elsif city == 'kolkata-tangra' -%}
          A taste from Kolkata's Tangra kitchens
        {%- elsif city == 'lucknow' -%}
          A taste that feels like Lucknow's galis
        {%- elsif city == 'kerala' -%}
          A taste that feels like Kerala's backwaters
        {%- elsif city == 'kashmir' -%}
          A taste that feels like Kashmir's valleys
        {%- elsif city == 'kolhapur' -%}
          A taste that feels like Kolhapur's kitchens
        {%- else -%}
          Stone-ground, the traditional way
        {%- endif -%}
      </p>
      {% render 'vishesh-sound-button', product: product %}
    </div>
    <div class="vishesh-city-scene__stage" aria-hidden="true">
      {%- case city -%}
        {%- when 'mumbai' -%}
          <svg
            class="vishesh-city-scene__svg"
            viewBox="0 0 800 220"
            preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMax slice"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          >
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="vm-sky" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
                <stop offset="0" stop-color="var(--color-cream)"/>
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="#fff9ee"/>
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <rect x="0" y="0" width="800" height="220" fill="url(#vm-sky)"/>

            <!-- Skyline, back layer (lightest, furthest) -->
            <g fill="var(--color-dark)" opacity="0.18">
              <rect x="0" y="86" width="34" height="94" rx="2"/>
              <rect x="40" y="102" width="26" height="78" rx="2"/>
              <rect x="120" y="94" width="30" height="86" rx="2"/>
              <rect x="600" y="90" width="30" height="90" rx="2"/>
              <rect x="700" y="100" width="26" height="80" rx="2"/>
              <rect x="748" y="82" width="34" height="98" rx="2"/>
            </g>

            <!-- Skyline, mid layer -->
            <g fill="var(--color-dark)" opacity="0.32">
              <rect x="66" y="70" width="30" height="110" rx="2"/>
              <path d="M96 70 h30 v-14 l-15 -12 -15 12 Z" opacity="0.9"/>
              <rect x="150" y="60" width="26" height="120" rx="2"/>
              <rect x="660" y="66" width="32" height="114" rx="2"/>
              <rect x="630" y="46" width="24" height="134" rx="2"/>
              <path d="M630 46 h24 v-12 l-12 -10 -12 10 Z"/>
            </g>

            <!-- Skyline, front layer (darkest, nearest) -->
            <g fill="var(--color-dark)" opacity="0.55">
              <rect x="10" y="118" width="40" height="62" rx="3"/>
              <rect x="176" y="96" width="34" height="84" rx="3"/>
              <path d="M176 96 h34 v-16 l-17 -13 -17 13 Z"/>
              <rect x="580" y="112" width="36" height="68" rx="3"/>
              <rect x="726" y="104" width="34" height="76" rx="3"/>
            </g>
            <!-- windows -->
            <g fill="var(--color-cream)" opacity="0.85">
              <rect x="18" y="128" width="5" height="7"/>
              <rect x="30" y="128" width="5" height="7"/>
              <rect x="18" y="142" width="5" height="7"/>
              <rect x="30" y="142" width="5" height="7"/>
              <rect x="18" y="156" width="5" height="7"/>
              <rect x="30" y="156" width="5" height="7"/>
              <rect x="184" y="108" width="5" height="7"/>
              <rect x="196" y="108" width="5" height="7"/>
              <rect x="184" y="122" width="5" height="7"/>
              <rect x="196" y="122" width="5" height="7"/>
              <rect x="588" y="122" width="5" height="7"/>
              <rect x="600" y="122" width="5" height="7"/>
              <rect x="588" y="136" width="5" height="7"/>
              <rect x="600" y="136" width="5" height="7"/>
              <rect x="734" y="114" width="5" height="7"/>
              <rect x="746" y="114" width="5" height="7"/>
            </g>

            <!-- ground -->
            <rect x="0" y="178" width="800" height="2" fill="var(--color-dark)" opacity="0.25"/>

            <!-- rail track for the local train -->
            <line x1="0" y1="168" x2="800" y2="168" stroke="var(--color-dark)" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.3"/>
            <g class="vishesh-city-scene__sleepers" opacity="0.3" stroke="var(--color-dark)" stroke-width="1.5">
              <line x1="20" y1="166" x2="20" y2="171"/>
              <line x1="60" y1="166" x2="60" y2="171"/>
              <line x1="100" y1="166" x2="100" y2="171"/>
              <line x1="140" y1="166" x2="140" y2="171"/>
              <line x1="180" y1="166" x2="180" y2="171"/>
            </g>

            <!-- local train, flat-design: rounded body, arched windows, coupled cars -->
            <g class="vishesh-city-scene__train" transform="translate(-220,120)">
              <path
                d="M0 28 Q0 8 16 8 H206 Q222 8 222 28 V44 Q222 48 218 48 H4 Q0 48 0 44 Z"
                fill="var(--color-primary)"
              />
              <rect x="0" y="30" width="222" height="6" fill="var(--color-primary-deep)"/>
              <g fill="var(--color-cream)">
                <path d="M14 16 h24 a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 v6 h-32 v-6 a4 4 0 0 1 4 -4 Z"/>
                <path d="M56 16 h24 a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 v6 h-32 v-6 a4 4 0 0 1 4 -4 Z"/>
                <path d="M98 16 h24 a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 v6 h-32 v-6 a4 4 0 0 1 4 -4 Z"/>
                <path d="M140 16 h24 a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 v6 h-32 v-6 a4 4 0 0 1 4 -4 Z"/>
                <path d="M182 16 h24 a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 v6 h-32 v-6 a4 4 0 0 1 4 -4 Z"/>
              </g>
              <circle cx="34" cy="52" r="8" fill="var(--color-dark)"/>
              <circle cx="34" cy="52" r="3" fill="var(--color-cream)" opacity="0.6"/>
              <circle cx="188" cy="52" r="8" fill="var(--color-dark)"/>
              <circle cx="188" cy="52" r="3" fill="var(--color-cream)" opacity="0.6"/>
            </g>

            <!-- auto-rickshaw, flat-design: curved canopy, rounded body, spoked wheels -->
            <g class="vishesh-city-scene__rickshaw" transform="translate(-110,148)">
              <path
                d="M4 26 Q4 4 24 4 H50 Q66 4 68 20 L70 26 Z"
                fill="var(--color-accent)"
              />
              <path d="M4 26 H70 Q76 26 76 32 V38 H0 V32 Q0 26 4 26 Z" fill="var(--color-primary)"/>
              <rect x="14" y="12" width="20" height="13" rx="2" fill="var(--color-cream)" opacity="0.85"/>
              <circle cx="10" cy="30" r="4" fill="var(--color-accent)"/>
              <circle cx="18" cy="40" r="9" fill="var(--color-dark)"/>
              <circle cx="18" cy="40" r="3.4" fill="var(--color-cream)" opacity="0.7"/>
              <circle cx="60" cy="40" r="9" fill="var(--color-dark)"/>
              <circle cx="60" cy="40" r="3.4" fill="var(--color-cream)" opacity="0.7"/>
            </g>
          </svg>
        {%- when 'delhi' -%}
          <svg
            class="vishesh-city-scene__svg"
            viewBox="0 0 800 220"
            preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMax slice"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
